  "body": "https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/1095 removed `isindex` element and `name=isindex` processing. Since there will be browsers in use for some time that do special processing for `<input name=isindex>`, it might be useful to ban that name for document conformance until such browsers are relics.\n\ncc @sideshowbarker \n",
